.TH MAN 10 "October 2026" "1.1" "Neverdark Manual"
.SH NAME
man \- Show an in\-game manual page
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B man
.RI [ topic ]
.SH DESCRIPTION
.PP
Show the manual page for
.IR topic ,
exactly like \fBhelp\fP: the two commands are the same tool under two names.
With no topic the beginner's page is shown.
.B man walk
.PP
teaches you to navigate, for example.
.PP
Topics are bare command names. A topic containing a slash, a double dot, or
a leading dash is refused outright: it would otherwise reach the manual
formatter as a file path or a flag.
.SH SEE ALSO
.BR help,begin (10)
.SH AUTHOR
quirinpa <quirinpa@tty.pt>
